From: HaHaWTH <102713261+HaHaWTH@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 1 Nov 2077 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lithium: Reduce Brain memories lookup

Cache Behavior#hasRequiredMemories until the associated Brain's memory registration or value-presence state changes.

Upstream revision:
01597fb879b7a6d17c2420ec4e25a98df3bc8e7b

This patch is based on the following Lithium mixins:
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/ai/task/memory_changes/BehaviorMixin.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/ai/task/memory_changes/BrainMixin.java"
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/mixin/ai/task/memory_changes/MemorySlotMixin.java"

It also ports the following supporting source:
* "net/caffeinemc/mods/lithium/common/ai/brain/memories/MemoryModificationCounter.java"
By: 2No2Name <2No2Name@web.de>
As part of: Lithium (https://github.com/CaffeineMC/lithium)
Licensed under: LGPL-3.0-only (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html)

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/Brain.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/Brain.java
